%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6cb25f3c1035093882f8e2fd756ed70, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Clerk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Data::EndlessDescent.Data.DialogueDefinition
  id: dialogue.npc.ashmere.0
  rootId: root
  lines:
  - Id: root
    Text: '{npc}, parish clerk. He has the register open and has not written in it.'
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: What happened here?
      GoTo: lamp
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
    - Text: Is there work?
      GoTo: taken
      Requires:
      - Kind: 9
        Faction: {fileID: 0}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: quest.act1.lamp
        Amount: 0
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      - Kind: 3
        Faction: {fileID: 0}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: quest.act1.lamp
        Amount: 0
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      Effects: []
      Action: 1
      QuestId: quest.act1.lamp
    - Text: About the undercroft.
      GoTo: thanks
      Requires:
      - Kind: 8
        Faction: {fileID: 0}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: quest.act1.lamp
        Amount: 0
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      Effects: []
      Action: 2
      QuestId: 
    - Text: Who keeps the register?
      GoTo: register
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
    - Text: Good day.
      GoTo: 
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 4
      QuestId: 
  - Id: lamp
    Text: The lamp in the Undercroft has burned every night for eleven years. It
      went out on Tuesday. Three went down to relight it. None came up. South-east
      of here, most of a day on foot, past the last of the fields.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: And the parish did nothing?
      GoTo: nothing
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: nothing
    Text: The parish sent three. That was doing something.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: ...
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: register
    Text: I do. Eleven years out of date, and the Wardens will not release a body
      without it. You can see the difficulty.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: I can.
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: taken
    Text: Then take a lamp of your own. The Undercroft is south-east of Ashmere,
      most of a day on foot. And do not go down there after dark, which is advice
      I am aware means nothing underground.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: Understood.
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: thanks
    Text: You came back up. That already makes you the fourth and the only one.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: There is more to say about it.
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
